# Mero - AI-Powered Infinite Canvas

**Project Type:** React Web Application with AI Integration
**Last Updated:** September 27, 2025
**Status:** Production Ready
**GitHub:** https://github.com/24pfilms/Mero.git

## 🎯 Project Overview
Mero is an advanced infinite canvas application combining creative workflows with cutting-edge AI capabilities. Users can create, edit, and collaborate with AI-powered media generation, speech recognition, and intelligent assistance.

## 📋 Latest Session Accomplishments (Sept 27, 2025)
✅ **MAJOR FIX:** Solved coordinate placement issues with visual mouse-following system
✅ Implemented MouseFollower component for precise object placement
✅ DOM-based coordinate calculation eliminates transformation bugs
✅ Objects now place exactly where mouse cursor clicks at all zoom levels
✅ Visual preview shows tool selection with crosshair precision
✅ **NEW:** Alt key hotkey for speech recognition (hold Alt = record, release = stop)
✅ Enhanced crop handles - made 40x40px with hover effects and better visibility
✅ Fixed Fal.ai environment variable access (`import.meta.env` vs `process.env`)
✅ Fixed API key configuration in both `falai.ts` and `useBoard.ts`
✅ Added speech-to-text to AI Assistant modal with microphone button
✅ Fixed critical Gemini API configuration issue (vite.config.ts)

## 🚀 Current Feature Set

### Core Canvas Features:
- Unlimited workspace with smooth pan/zoom
- **NEW:** Visual mouse-following placement system with pixel-perfect accuracy
- Multi-item types: sticky notes, shapes, text, images, videos, frames
- Drag & drop file support
- Resizable/rotatable items with visual handles
- Layering controls (bring to front/send to back)
- Export: PNG, JPG, PDF, CSV
- Flexible toolbar positioning (top/left/bottom/right)
- DOM-based coordinate calculation (eliminates transformation bugs)

### AI-Powered Features:
- **AI Assistant:** Gemini integration with streaming responses
- **🎙️ Speech-to-Text:** Web Speech API in AI chat and text editing
- **AI Image Editing:** Nano Banana model via Fal.ai
- **Image-to-Video:** Veo 2 Fast model for video generation
- **Context Integration:** Right-click menus for AI options
- **Edit History:** Track all AI modifications

### Media & Integration:
- YouTube video embedding with controls
- Obsidian vault integration
- Image controls: maximize/minimize/crop/rotate
- Download functionality for all media
- Real-time preview for AI edits

### Speech Recognition:
- Available in: AI Assistant, text editing, sticky notes  
- **Alt Key Hotkey:** Hold Alt to record, release to stop (push-to-talk)
- **Button Control:** Click microphone for manual start/stop
- Visual feedback: Red (listening), Green (success), Gray (ready), Ring (hotkey active)
- Cross-browser support (WebKit + standard APIs)
- Smart text handling (appends to existing content)
- Graceful error handling and window focus management

## 💻 Technical Architecture

### Core Stack:
- React 19.1.1 + TypeScript 5.8.2
- Vite 6.2.0 (build tool)
- Tailwind CSS (styling)
- D3.js 7.9.0 (canvas interactions)

### AI Services:
- Google Gemini API (@google/genai 1.21.0)
- Fal.ai Client (@fal-ai/client 1.6.2)
- Web Speech API (browser native)

### Key Dependencies:
- html2canvas 1.4.1 (export functionality)
- jspdf 2.5.1 (PDF export)

### Project Structure:
```
Mero/
├── components/           # React UI components
│   ├── AiAssistantModal.tsx     # Gemini chat + speech-to-text
│   ├── AiImageEditModal.tsx     # Nano Banana integration
│   ├── ImageToVideoModal.tsx    # Veo 2 Fast integration
│   ├── MouseFollower.tsx        # NEW: Visual placement preview
│   ├── Board.tsx               # Main canvas component
│   ├── BoardItemComponent.tsx  # Individual canvas items
│   ├── Toolbar.tsx            # Main toolbar
│   ├── ContextMenu.tsx        # Right-click menus
│   └── icons.tsx             # SVG icon library
├── hooks/               # Custom React hooks
│   ├── useBoard.ts            # Main canvas logic
│   ├── useSpeechRecognition.ts # Speech API wrapper
│   └── useDraggableModal.ts   # Modal dragging
├── services/            # External API integrations
│   └── falai.ts              # Fal.ai service layer
├── types.ts            # TypeScript definitions
├── App.tsx            # Main app component
└── vite.config.ts     # Build configuration
```

## 🔧 Environment Configuration

### Required API Keys (.env.local):
```env
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy... # Google AI Studio API key
VITE_FAL_KEY=9e4d3130-...     # Fal.ai API key for image/video AI
```

### Important Configuration Files:
- **vite.config.ts:** Maps environment variables correctly
- **package.json:** All dependencies and scripts
- **tsconfig.json:** TypeScript configuration

### Setup Commands:
```bash
npm install
npm run dev  # Runs on http://localhost:3000
```

